application_approved.body:
Your application was approved and you are registered as a UAS operator.

Registration number: {number}
Secret part: {secret}
Valid until: {valid_until}

The secret part is shown only in this message and the authority keeps no readable copy of it: keep it safe. Your full number, as your aircraft's Remote ID is loaded with it, is {number}-{secret}.

The state of your application: {link}

